{"title": "France Imposes Curfews Amid Widespread Unrest", "summary": "France has extended curfews in some cities as authorities moved to quell widespread unrest. The Prime Minister announced new targeted curfews would be imposed where needed. The unrest has compounded fears of a debt crisis, with Paris-listed stocks, bonds, and the euro experiencing a fall. Former US President Donald Trump has commented on the situation, hailing Marine Le Pen as a 'conservative voice'. Meanwhile, Hungary and Poland have defended their tough migration policies in the context of the French disturbances.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "फ्रांस में व्यापक अशांति के बीच कर्फ्यू लागू", "summary_hi": "फ्रांस ने व्यापक अशांति को नियंत्रित करने के लिए अधिकारियों द्वारा कुछ शहरों में कर्फ्यू बढ़ा दिया है। प्रधानमंत्री ने घोषणा की कि जहां जरूरत होगी वहां नए लक्षित कर्फ्यू लगाए जाएंगे। इस अशांति ने ऋण संकट की आशंकाओं को बढ़ा दिया है, जिससे पेरिस-सूचीबद्ध स्टॉक, बॉन्ड और यूरो में गिरावट आई है। पूर्व अमेरिकी राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प ने स्थिति पर टिप्पणी करते हुए मैरीन ले पेन को 'रूढ़िवादी आवाज' बताया है। इस बीच, हंगरी और पोलैंड ने फ्रांसीसी गड़बड़ी के संदर्भ में अपनी कठोर प्रवासन नीतियों का बचाव किया है।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["France extended curfews in some cities as restrictions aimed to quell unrest.", "Prime Minister announced new targeted curfews would be imposed where needed.", "Unrest compounded debt crisis fears, leading to a fall in Paris-listed stocks, bonds, and the euro.", "Donald Trump hailed Marine Le Pen as a 'conservative voice' amid the unrest.", "Hungary and Poland defended their tough migration policies in light of the French situation."], "right": ["OpIndia coverage compared Western media's reporting of French protests as 'Mostly Peaceful' to its coverage of Indian demonstrations, alleging double standards.", "Times Now coverage linked the violent unrest in France to shaping US midterm campaigns."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["फ्रांस ने प्रतिब